<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U says completes Huhtamaki deal.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U says completes Huhtamaki deal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish/U.S. drugs group Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn said on Monday it had completed the sale of three million shares in Finnish drugs company Huhtamaki to Huhtamaki's Dutch finance company.</p>
<p>A definitive agreement for the deal, which was reached on July 16 and which will be finalised on September 5, was reached on Monday, P&amp;U said in a statement.</p>
<p>The price paid per share will be 170 markka, P&amp;U said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
